Description: Setup zswapd  as your swap partition.
 zswapd is a daemon that manages the zswap compressed cache for swap pages.
 It allows you to configure the size of the cache, the compression algorithm,
 and other parameters to optimize performance.
 .
 This package provides a systemd service to manage zswapd automatically.
 It also includes a configuration file for easy customization.

